OL,3,AAt least one dead and four injured in
OL,4,AParis suburb shooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne person has been killed and at least
OL,7,Ffour others injured in a Parisian
OL,8,Fsuburb, in what police are treating as
OL,9,Fa "terrorist incident".
OL,11,FFrench Prime Minister Sebastien Lecornu
OL,12,Fsaid the "very serious events" happened
OL,13,Fin Trappes, to the west of Paris,
OL,14,Fadding that the suspected attack had
OL,15,Fbeen "apprehended and placed in police
OL,16,Fcustody".
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,0,100
