OL,3,AAt least one dead and four injured in
OL,4,AParis suburb shooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe National Anti-Terrorist
OL,7,FProsecutor's Office (PNAT) said it had
OL,8,Ftaken on the investigation into the
OL,9,Fincident, which appeared to be "murder
OL,10,Fin connection with a terrorist
OL,11,Fenterprise".
OL,13,FReports in French media suggest the
OL,14,Fnumber of injured may be higher and
OL,15,Fthat a 12-year-old child may be among
OL,16,Fthem.
